IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `P9-gate`
IMPORT `P9-art-82-84`

-- Tests for Articles 82, 83 and 84. Expected values are written from the text of the Articles, Article 113 (group General
-- from 2 August 2026) and Article 111(2) (a high-risk AI system placed on the market before the date of application of
-- Chapter III is saved unless it is significantly changed in its design), never copied from the encoding's own output.
-- args (Articles 82 and 83): the date asked, the AI system, then the facts in the order of the function's GIVEN.

§ `The AI systems the tests use`

`the new Annex I system` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2030
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`the new Annex III system` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2030
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`the legacy Annex III system` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`the changed legacy Annex III system` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS TRUE

`the system that is not high-risk` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2020
    `route` IS `Route neither`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

§ `Article 82(1)`

-- args: date asked, system, found under Article 79 that it presents a risk, consulted the national public authority (Article 77(1)), the high-risk system complies, it nevertheless presents a risk
#ASSERT `Art 82(1) the market surveillance authority must require the relevant operator to take all appropriate measures` (Date 1 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 82(1) the market surveillance authority must require the relevant operator to take all appropriate measures` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 82(1) the market surveillance authority must require the relevant operator to take all appropriate measures` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 82(1) the market surveillance authority must require the relevant operator to take all appropriate measures` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 82(1) the market surveillance authority must require the relevant operator to take all appropriate measures` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 82(1) the market surveillance authority must require the relevant operator to take all appropriate measures` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- A system that is not high-risk: the paragraph does not speak to it.
#ASSERT `Art 82(1) the market surveillance authority must require the relevant operator to take all appropriate measures` (Date 2 8 2026) `the system that is not high-risk` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Article 111(2): a legacy high-risk system is saved; changed in its design it is covered.
#ASSERT `Art 82(1) the market surveillance authority must require the relevant operator to take all appropriate measures` (Date 2 8 2028) `the legacy Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 82(1) the market surveillance authority must require the relevant operator to take all appropriate measures` (Date 2 8 2028) `the changed legacy Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE

§ `Article 82(2)`

-- args: date asked, system, the authority has required the operator to take measures, number of AI systems concerned made available, number with corrective action taken within the timeline
#ASSERT `Art 82(2) the provider or other relevant operator has ensured that corrective action is taken` (Date 1 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE 3 3 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 82(2) the provider or other relevant operator has ensured that corrective action is taken` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE 3 3 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 82(2) the provider or other relevant operator has ensured that corrective action is taken` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE 3 2 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 82(2) the provider or other relevant operator has ensured that corrective action is taken` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE FALSE 3 3 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 82(2) the provider or other relevant operator has ensured that corrective action is taken` (Date 2 8 2028) `the legacy Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE 3 3 EQUALS NOTHING

-- The duty with the authority's timeline: 1 September 2026 to 1 October 2026.
-- args: date asked, system, the authority has required the operator to take measures, day the timeline began, day it ends
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 82(2) the duty of the provider or other relevant operator to ensure corrective action` (Date 2 9 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE (Date 1 9 2026) (Date 1 10 2026) AT (Day (Date 1 9 2026)) WITH
    PARTY `Art 82 the provider or other relevant operator` DOES `Art 82(2) ensure that corrective action is taken in respect of all the AI systems concerned made available on the Union market` AT (Day (Date 1 10 2026))
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 82(2) the duty of the provider or other relevant operator to ensure corrective action` (Date 2 9 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE (Date 1 9 2026) (Date 1 10 2026) AT (Day (Date 1 9 2026)) WITH
    PARTY `Art 82 the provider or other relevant operator` DOES `Art 82(2) ensure that corrective action is taken in respect of all the AI systems concerned made available on the Union market` AT (Day (Date 2 10 2026))
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 82(2) the duty of the provider or other relevant operator to ensure corrective action` (Date 2 9 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE (Date 1 9 2026) (Date 1 10 2026) AT (Day (Date 1 9 2026)) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 2 10 2026))
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 82(2) the duty of the provider or other relevant operator to ensure corrective action` (Date 2 9 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE FALSE (Date 1 9 2026) (Date 1 10 2026) AT (Day (Date 1 9 2026)) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 2 10 2026))
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 82(2) the duty of the provider or other relevant operator to ensure corrective action` (Date 1 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE (Date 1 9 2026) (Date 1 10 2026) AT (Day (Date 1 9 2026)) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 2 10 2026))
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 82(2) the duty of the provider or other relevant operator to ensure corrective action` (Date 2 9 2028) `the legacy Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE (Date 1 9 2028) (Date 1 10 2028) AT (Day (Date 1 9 2028)) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 2 10 2028))
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 82(2) the duty of the provider or other relevant operator to ensure corrective action` (Date 2 9 2028) `the changed legacy Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE (Date 1 9 2028) (Date 1 10 2028) AT (Day (Date 1 9 2028)) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 2 10 2028))

