#ASSERT `Art 82(3) the information must include the detail` `Art 82(3) the supply chain of the AI system` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 82(3) the information must include the detail` `Art 82(3) the nature of the risk involved` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 82(3) the information must include the detail` `Art 82(3) the nature and duration of the national measures taken` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 82(3) the information must include the detail` `Art 82(3) another available detail` EQUALS NOTHING

